# Deny by default. This repository tracks maintainable source and contracts only.
*

# Repository governance and maintenance documents.
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/verify-monorepo-policy.py
!.codex/
.codex/*
!.codex/governance/
!.codex/governance/**

# Active Alpha source package.
!active-alpha-paper-monitor/
active-alpha-paper-monitor/*
